---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import CtaBand from '../components/CtaBand.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About Andrew & Sinchi | Local SEO & Google Maps NZ"
  description="Meet Andrew, the engineer behind Sinchi. Bringing 20+ years of high-stakes systems engineering to local search and Google Maps ranking for NZ businesses."
>
  <section class="section about-hero">
    <div class="container container-narrow">
      <div class="about-header">
        <div class="badge-pill">
          <span class="badge-dot"></span>
          <span>E-E-A-T & Engineering Discipline</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="about-title">The engineer's approach to local search</h1>
        <p class="about-subtitle">
          Why a background in mission-critical security systems produces better Google Maps rankings than generic marketing fluff.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="about-story-card card-surface">
        <div class="profile-row">
          <div class="profile-avatar-box">
            <img
              src="/brand/avatar.png"
              alt="Andrew, Founder of Sinchi"
              width="120"
              height="120"
              class="profile-img"
              loading="eager"
            />
            <span class="engineer-tag">Andrew Kelso</span>
            <span class="engineer-role">Founder & Systems Specialist</span>
          </div>
          <div class="profile-intro">
            <h2 class="intro-headline">"Search engines are rule-based systems. We treat them like engineering problems."</h2>
            <p>
              I spent 20+ years designing, testing, and commissioning high-stakes electronic security and infrastructure systems. In that world, guesswork is unacceptable. If a sensor fails or a communication protocol drops, the system fails.
            </p>
            <p>
              When I looked at how most SEO agencies treated local New Zealand businesses, I saw the exact opposite: vague reports, buzzwords, lock-in contracts, and zero accountability.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="story-content">
          <h3>How Sinchi operates differently</h3>
          <p>
            Sinchi was built on a simple premise: Google Maps rankings are determined by measurable inputs such as primary category hierarchy, geographic grid relevance, review cadence, and website schema alignment.
          </p>
          <p>
            Instead of charging thousands for bloated agency overhead, we leverage smart AI automation to handle the data collection and monitoring. That means you pay strictly for high-impact fixes that generate calls, not administrative fluff.
          </p>

          <div class="remote-notice-box">
            <h4>🇳🇿 100% Focused on New Zealand (Remote Service Model)</h4>
            <p>
              We want to be completely upfront: Sinchi operates as a specialized remote consultancy serving Kiwi businesses across Auckland, Hamilton, Tauranga, Wellington, Christchurch, Dunedin, and regional NZ. We don't pretend to have a physical high-street storefront in every town, because honest communication is the bedrock of how we work.
            </p>
          </div>

          <h3>Our core engineering principles</h3>
          <ul class="principles-list">
            <li>
              <strong>1. Test and Measure Everything:</strong> We never guess why a competitor is outranking you. We inspect the raw data across every suburb grid point.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>2. Plain English Reporting:</strong> You will never receive a 40-page jargon PDF. You get clear numbers: your rank position, your phone call trends, and what was fixed.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>3. No Ranking Guarantees (Fair Trading Act):</strong> Google controls search algorithms. We never make illegal #1 guarantees; we deliver the rigorous optimization that puts the odds heavily in your favor.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>4. Zero Lock-In Contracts:</strong> We operate on flexible month-to-month agreements. You stay because your phone is ringing.
            </li>
          </ul>

          <div class="author-social-row">
            <span class="social-label">Connect with Andrew:</span>
            <a
              href="https://www.linkedin.com"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="linkedin-link"
            >
              LinkedIn Profile ↗
            </a>
            <span class="divider">·</span>
            <a href="mailto:hello@sinchi.co.nz" class="email-link">
              hello@sinchi.co.nz
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA Band -->
  <CtaBand
    title="Want an engineer to inspect your Google visibility?"
    subtitle="Request your free visibility check. We'll show you exactly where your listing stands today."
    primaryButtonText="Get my free check"
  />
</Layout>

<style>
  .about-hero {
    padding-top: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5.5rem);
    padding-bottom: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 4.5rem);
  }

  .about-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .about-title {
    font-size: clamp(2.15rem, 4.5vw, 3.25rem);
    line-height: 1.15;
  }

  .about-subtitle {
    font-size: 1.1875rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    max-width: 620px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .about-story-card {
    padding: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
  }

  .profile-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 2.5rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
    padding-bottom: 2.25rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
    margin-bottom: 2.25rem;
  }

  .profile-avatar-box {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .profile-img {
    width: 110px;
    height: 110px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    border: 3px solid var(--color-primary-light);
    box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(157, 56, 224, 0.4);
    object-fit: cover;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .engineer-tag {
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
  }

  .engineer-role {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .profile-intro {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .intro-headline {
    font-size: 1.375rem;
    color: var(--color-primary-light);
    line-height: 1.35;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .profile-intro p {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    color: var(--color-text-main);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .story-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .story-content h3 {
    font-size: 1.375rem;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .story-content p {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .remote-notice-box {
    background: rgba(157, 56, 224, 0.12);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--color-primary-light);
    border-radius: 0 var(--radius-md) var(--radius-md) 0;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
  }

  .remote-notice-box h4 {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    color: #FFFFFF;
  }

  .remote-notice-box p {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--color-text-main);
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .principles-list {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .principles-list li {
    background: rgba(18, 2, 31, 0.6);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--color-text-main);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--color-primary-light);
  }

  .principles-list strong {
    color: #FFFFFF;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
  }

  .author-social-row {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    padding-top: 1.25rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .social-label {
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #FFFFFF;
  }

  .linkedin-link,
  .email-link {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-primary-light);
  }

  .divider {
    color: var(--color-border);
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .profile-row {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      text-align: center;
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
